rem Maximum Product of Parts
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=183
rem Sum N or -N for N from 5 to Limit,
rem by whether the largest product of
rem equal parts of N has a decimal
rem expansion that ends or goes on

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Limit integer = 10000

rem The product (N / k)^k is greatest
rem for k near N / e. It terminates when
rem the reduced denominator of N / k has
rem only the factors 2 and 5.
Ns = 5 to Limit array
E = 1 exp
Lo = (Ns / E) floor
Hi = Lo + 1
LogLo' = (Ns / Lo) log
LogHi' = (Ns / Hi) log
FLo' = Lo * LogLo
FHi' = Hi * LogHi
Up' = FHi greater FLo
K = Up choose Hi Lo
Den' = K // (Ns gcd K)
Ten = 2 ** 14 * 5 ** 6
Ends' = Ten mod Den equal 0
Sign' = Ends choose (0 - Ns) Ns
Answer = Sign sum
Answer print
